abstract: >
DataProcessingPlatform contains computational tools used for data analysis
and theoretical simulations of the tunneling magneto-dielectric response
in magnetic nanogranular films. This archived version accompanies the study
"A compact formula for the maximum tunneling magneto-dielectric response
in nanogranular films."

keywords:

* tunneling magneto-dielectric effect
* nanogranular films
* spin polarization
* dielectric relaxation
* numerical simulation
